{"taskId":"lawn-r5-b-morphology","name":"blade_shape_gate","fields":["base_width","tip_width","length","endpoint_distance","socket_drift"],"purpose":"跨岗复核草叶截面、叶尖与根socket","specification":"Deliver a scalar quality gate for one decoded leaf. Inputs in metres: full base/body width and actual tip width, centreline length, endpoint chord, old/new root drift. Return integer 1 iff all are finite-by-contract, width and length positive, tip_width in [0,base_width], 0<=endpoint_distance<=length+1e-7 and 0<=socket_drift<=1e-6. Review the real candidate change: ratio of median tip/max width moves 0.281 to 0.656: when is this plausible for a clipped leaf, when does it look like a ribbon? Give a quantitative per-class clipped/natural diagnostic and one actual file-level choice; do not infer botanical species.","evidence":{"candidateSourceFile":"lib/capture-meadow.ts","candidateFileSha256":"c1631df8ff8ed83a093b23c855dcadbaacc67503ae857f77d8847634df13cc04","lines":[74,149],"source":"function tuftGeometry(tier:Tier,variant:number,seed:number) {
  // Generate one physical tuft. Coarser meshes retain a nested subset of the
  // same blades, their shoot sockets, centerlines, widths and pigmentation.
  const next=random(hash(0,variant,seed^0x4c351));
  const allBlades=Array.from({length:39+variant},(_,i)=>i);
  const sample=(ids:number[],count:number)=>Array.from({length:count},(_,i)=>ids[Math.floor((i+.5)*ids.length/count)]);
  const mid=sample(allBlades,10+variant);
  const sourceBladeIds=tier===0?allBlades:tier===1?mid:sample(mid,5+variant);
  const retained=new Set(sourceBladeIds);
  const position:number[]=[],color:number[]=[],index:number[]=[];
  const rows=tier===0?[0,.22,.48,.76,1]:tier===1?[0,.48,1]:[0,1];
  const columns=tier===0?3:2;
  const shoots=Array.from({length:Math.ceil(allBlades.length/1.5)},()=>{
    const angle=next()*Math.PI*2,r=Math.sqrt(next())*.036;
    // A runner's position and the azimuth of its grass shoot are independent.
    return {x:Math.cos(angle)*r,z:Math.sin(angle)*r,a:next()*Math.PI*2};
  });
  for(const k of allBlades){
    const shoot=shoots[k%shoots.length], angle=shoot.a+(k%3)*2.17+(next()-.5)*1.05;
    const cx=Math.cos(angle),cz=Math.sin(angle),sx=-cz,sz=cx;
    // Keep the same random draws through the root socket across revisions.
    // The photos resolve a low, continuous sward. Blade dimensions come
    // from a fine-textured turf prior, not a species ID or campus caliper.
    const young=k%5<2;
    const length=young?.024+.017*next():.041+.020*next();
    const initialAngle=young?.16+.38*next():.32+.41*next();
    const twist=(next()-.5)*1.12;
    const halfWidth=.00082+.00054*next();
    const tint=next(),clipped=next()<.74;
    const rootX=shoot.x+(next()-.5)*.004,rootZ=shoot.z+(next()-.5)*.004;
    if(!retained.has(k))continue;
    const shape=random(hash(k,variant,seed^0x4cf69));
    const sweep=young?.45+.65*shape():.82+.82*shape();
    const cutWidth=clipped?.46+.37*shape():.035;
    const cutSlant=clipped?(shape()-.5)*1.15:0;
    const dry=shape()<.09?.5+.38*shape():.05*shape();
    const offset=position.length/3;
    for(let j=0;j<rows.length;j++){
      const t=rows[j],angleAt=initialAngle+sweep*t;
      // Integrate the centreline tangent by arc length. Mature outer blades
      // can return towards the ground beyond their crown; young blades arch less.
      const reach=length*(Math.cos(initialAngle)-Math.cos(angleAt))/sweep;
      const lift=length*(Math.sin(angleAt)-Math.sin(initialAngle))/sweep;
      const crossTurn=twist*t*t;
      const sideX=sx*Math.cos(crossTurn)-cx*Math.sin(crossTurn)*Math.cos(angleAt);
      const sideZ=sz*Math.cos(crossTurn)-cz*Math.sin(crossTurn)*Math.cos(angleAt);
      const sideY=Math.sin(crossTurn)*Math.sin(angleAt);
      // Narrow sheath opens by the lower third. The lamina then narrows
      // continuously toward its intact point or a wider, obliquely cut tip.
      const sheath=.82+.18*Math.sin(.5*Math.PI*Math.min(1,t/.32));
      const width=halfWidth*sheath*(1-(1-cutWidth)*t*t);
      const light=.75+.22*t+.12*tint;
      const tipDry=dry*(.12+.88*t*t*t);
      for(let l=0;l<columns;l++){
        const u=2*l/(columns-1)-1;
        const midrib=(1-Math.abs(u))*width*.20*Math.sin(Math.PI*t);
        const along=t===1?width*u*cutSlant:0;
        position.push(rootX+cx*(reach+along*Math.sin(angleAt))+sideX*u*width,
          lift+along*Math.cos(angleAt)+sideY*u*width+midrib,
          rootZ+cz*(reach+along*Math.sin(angleAt))+sideZ*u*width);
        const lamina=light*(1-.065*Math.sin(Math.PI*t)*(1-Math.abs(u)));
        color.push((.115+.077*tint+.105*tipDry)*lamina,
          (.204+.096*tint+.021*tipDry)*lamina,(.028+.025*tint+.013*tipDry)*lamina);
      }
      if(j>0)for(let l=0;l<columns-1;l++){
        const a=offset+(j-1)*columns+l,b=a+1,c=a+columns,d=c+1;
        index.push(a,c,b,b,c,d);
      }
    }
  }
  const geometry=new THREE.BufferGeometry();
  geometry.setAttribute('position',new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(position,3));
  geometry.setAttribute('color',new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(color,3));
  geometry.setIndex(index);geometry.computeVertexNormals();geometry.computeBoundingSphere();
  geometry.name=`Turf blades ${tierName[tier]} ${variant+1}`;
  geometry.userData={bladesPerTuft:sourceBladeIds.length,detailTier:tierName[tier],sourceBladeIds,sampleRows:rows};","matchedMeshMeasurements":{"R4":{"sha256":"980b3ee316686056c30c0de74979d64ee146d474dca4c6b3943abff7c5a50f72","nearBladeCount":162,"note":"Local coordinates of four representative near-detail blade variants; metrics measured from decoded geometric side-edge midpoint cross-sections. Excludes instance scale and animation.","height":{"min":0.023436665534973145,"median":0.04079177603125572,"max":0.06662990897893906},"tipReach":{"min":0.011274643862821615,"median":0.021136606607223034,"max":0.042898308151100795},"arc":{"min":0.026706377458257307,"median":0.04740566496905022,"max":0.08059048082840416},"maxWidth":{"min":0.0015996374061599543,"median":0.0023652037889088503,"max":0.003346005478231651},"tipWidth":{"min":7.334673474933853e-05,"median":0.0005644076190141833,"max":0.0009405462918079454},"tipFraction":{"min":0.04517489650774648,"median":0.2810952162860454,"max":0.2810964332420972}},"R5":{"sha256":"c42107ad01d5dc393c6b0cda5e7aeb95b302a835ea79d1730192a60fc11deca3","nearBladeCount":162,"note":"Local coordinates of four representative near-detail blade variants; metrics measured from decoded geometric side-edge midpoint cross-sections. Excludes instance scale and animation.","height":{"min":0.002891586162149906,"median":0.02192641142755747,"max":0.040982864797115326},"tipReach":{"min":0.01103369638732519,"median":0.035853981366818825,"max":0.054361323708363274},"arc":{"min":0.0243413507776729,"median":0.04348846323090807,"max":0.06059561169926576},"maxWidth":{"min":0.001558437716903928,"median":0.002009421803892246,"max":0.002611053530601405},"tipWidth":{"min":5.846029490429732e-05,"median":0.0013046893093388587,"max":0.002276243016359167},"tipFraction":{"min":0.03751121328125265,"median":0.6560767372364679,"max":0.9399332880452254}},"paired":{"allIdsMatch":true,"maxPlanarSocketDriftM":1.9199706733309015e-09,"maxVerticalSocketDriftM":0.0}},"R4RootGroundCounts":{"coreWorldXZ":[-8,8,-28,-4],"sitesInWholeScene":510687,"scope":"Deterministic scene root counts. Candidate quadrat masking uses 25 uniformly spaced sample locations and additional clearance; results describe the model, not measured field species or biomass.","regions":{"1":{"areaPerQuadratM2":1,"eligibleQuadrats":322,"sampleMeanCount":204.8975155279503,"sampleVariance":213.76828041253071,"observedRange":[170,239],"densityRootsPerM2":204.8975155279503,"dispersion":1.0432936673815858},"0.25":{"areaPerQuadratM2":0.0625,"eligibleQuadrats":5470,"sampleMeanCount":12.785374771480804,"sampleVariance":3.9382025931099744,"observedRange":[4,19],"densityRootsPerM2":204.56599634369286,"dispersion":0.30802402459836936},"0.5":{"areaPerQuadratM2":0.25,"eligibleQuadrats":1339,"sampleMeanCount":51.18371919342793,"sampleVariance":21.761438773106704,"observedRange":[35,64],"densityRootsPerM2":204.73487677371173,"dispersion":0.4251632963768859}}},"R5RootGroundCounts":{"coreWorldXZ":[-8,8,-28,-4],"sitesInWholeScene":510687,"scope":"Deterministic scene root counts. Candidate quadrat masking uses 25 uniformly spaced sample locations and additional clearance; results describe the model, not measured field species or biomass.","regions":{"1":{"areaPerQuadratM2":1,"eligibleQuadrats":322,"sampleMeanCount":204.8975155279503,"sampleVariance":213.76828041253071,"observedRange":[170,239],"densityRootsPerM2":204.8975155279503,"dispersion":1.0432936673815858},"0.25":{"areaPerQuadratM2":0.0625,"eligibleQuadrats":5470,"sampleMeanCount":12.785374771480804,"sampleVariance":3.9382025931099744,"observedRange":[4,19],"densityRootsPerM2":204.56599634369286,"dispersion":0.30802402459836936},"0.5":{"areaPerQuadratM2":0.25,"eligibleQuadrats":1339,"sampleMeanCount":51.18371919342793,"sampleVariance":21.761438773106704,"observedRange":[35,64],"densityRootsPerM2":204.73487677371173,"dispersion":0.4251632963768859}}},"sameWorldModel":"Original 384606 sites plus 126081 engineered transitions. All documentary/photo interpretations must retain uncertainty; no new biological or radiometric measurements.","validationPrivacy":"independent holdout boxes have been frozen by SHA256; only the original training ROI evidence is present."},"handoff":[{"taskId":"lawn-r5-a-morphology","actualResponseText":"{
  "name": "blade_half_width",
  "expression": "base if t <= 0 else (base * tip_fraction if t >= 1 else base * (1 - (1 - tip_fraction) * t * t))",
  "diagnosis": "【物理测量与尺度】现有几何尺度依赖灯高为3.41 m的假设；没有实测叶宽、叶长或匹配的真实近景。不能将代码中的尺寸范围解释成校园草种的测量结果。\n【模型先验与代码缺陷】lib/capture-meadow.ts 的 tuftGeometry(tier,variant,seed) 当前在根部给出0.78倍halfWidth，在t=0.44处约为0.996倍，之后收窄；因此它先增宽，不满足本次要求的非递增轮廓。候选采用二次收窄：在0<t<1处导数为-2*base*(1-tip_fraction)*t，不大于0；相对线性收窄的增量为base*(1-tip_fraction)*t*(1-t)，非负。整个表达式连续，输出位于[base*tip_fraction,base]；tip_fraction=1时恒宽。这是可检查的形态先验，不是物种推断。\n【图像结论】注册远景仍存在明显明暗差异：01的所给ratio为照片0.07005、R4_blades 0.15332；13分别为0.05525、0.18865。01第三个阴影ROI的水平亮度差分为照片0.0044037、R4_blades 0.0126928，说明局部纹理已可能过强，不能笼统要求增加细节。两台注册相机nearBlades均为0，不能以这些远景证明近景叶形正确。近景裁图中较硬、片状的叶片观感可作为排查假设，但没有匹配真实近景支持其具体成因。",
  "codeChange": "修改文件：lib/capture-meadow.ts。新增确切函数：\nfunction blade_half_width(t:number, base:number, tip_fraction:number):number {\n  if (t <= 0) return base;\n  if (t >= 1) return base * tip_fraction;\n  return base * (1 - (1 - tip_fraction) * t * t);\n}\n\n在 tuftGeometry(tier,variant,seed) 内，将原width赋值替换为：\nconst width=blade_half_width(t,halfWidth,clipped?.28:.045);\n\n将rows改为：\nconst rows=tier===0?[0,.44,.77,1]:[0,.44,1];\n这使far也采样t=0.44；否则仅连接两端的far网格仍是线性轮廓，无法表达候选的中段加宽。保留columns原规则；far每叶三角形从2个增至4个，作为明确的成本变化记录。\n\n为让clipped叶片的末端边位于同一修剪高度，在顶点循环中新增：\nconst ridge=(1-Math.abs(u))*width*.29*(clipped?1-t:1);\n并仅将position.push中的纵坐标替换为height*t+ridge，横向坐标公式不变。该处理保留非零末端宽度，同时让clipped叶片在t=1处的横向顶点等高；它仍是零厚度叶面，不宣称生成了实体切口封盖。\n\n保持halfWidth采样、clipped概率、.28/.045末端比例、短叶判定、height/lean/curl/tint/root参数及所有next()调用顺序不变。不得把if(!retained.has(k))continue前移。保持allBlades、mid和far的嵌套sourceBladeIds选择不变，使同一(variant,seed,k)在各LOD保留相同叶鞘插入点、解剖随机参数及共同采样高度的宽度。上述数值均沿用模型先验，不新增物种或实测尺寸主张。",
  "validation": "以下是待执行的本地验证计划，本回答未运行代码或渲染。\n1. 在拟新增的tests/blade-half-width.test.ts中验证blade_half_width。base取现有采样范围的两个端值0.00079、0.00168 m，tip_fraction取0、0.045、0.28、0.5、1，t覆盖-1、0、1、2以及[0,1]上的1025个等距点。端点分支应精确返回base和base*tip_fraction；界限、相邻点非递增及不窄于线性轮廓采用1e-12 m容差。另测距0和1各1e-8的内外点，端点跳差不得超过1e-10 m。任一越界、增宽或连续性检查失败即拒绝候选。\n2. 固定seed=1942029223，对实际使用的全部variant生成三档几何。以(variant,seed,k)为键，比较修改前后的sourceBladeIds、shoot/root坐标、height、lean、curl、tint、clipped及随机调用次数；要求逐项完全一致。跨LOD比较共同t处的侧边顶点和宽度，容差1e-9 m。密度fingerprint须仍为5b2814093ed8bf4c4bc3feb2bf988ffbf3c5c4a2bc588bb9ea73c7ca66b7849a；任一身份或随机流变化即失败。\n3. 对每档每个clipped叶片检查t=1横向顶点的y均等于height，误差不超过1e-9 m，末端半宽等于halfWidth*0.28。检查三角形非退化、法线有限，并重算包围体；按既有正负12 ms形变条件验证最大水平根部可达范围不超过0.108 m。任一失败即回退；tip_fraction=0仅用于函数边界测试，不混入生产网格。\n4. 锁定现有相机、1024×768输出、种子、曝光、光照、材质、密度和ROI，分别重渲染01、13及三个原近景视口。每个注册ROI重新统计线性sRGB的Rec.709亮度中位数、水平/垂直相邻差分、p10、p90，并使用原流程重算ratio。设工程回归门槛：任一相机ratio相对照片的绝对误差比R4_blades增加超过0.005，或任一阴影ROI水平/垂直差分相对照片的绝对误差增加超过0.001，则不合入。这是预先声明的工程门槛，不是照片测量精度。\n5. 近景另输出带k标签的三档线框及修剪端特写，检查共同叶片是否换插入点、末端是否出现折扇状尖峰、LOD切换是否跳宽；这些检查只验证模型内部一致性。记录增加far采样后的顶点数、三角形数、drawCalls和同机同设置的重复帧耗时；drawCalls应维持注册视角的8次且不得超过既有上限12次，帧耗时中位数若高于修改前10%则拒绝本轮far细分方案，不用降低密度掩盖成本。",
  "uncertainty": "照片未经辐射定标且缺少仅地面深度，现有阴影偏亮和纹理差异不能归因于单一叶宽函数。中段相对线性加宽、根部不再只有0.78倍宽以及far新增一行都可能增加投影覆盖，也可能加重阴影区纹理。末端比例0.28/0.045与clipped概率0.74只是保留的模型先验，照片不能验证其修剪分布。近景修剪边等高是候选几何约束，不代表已恢复真实断面厚度；没有匹配近景前，只能报告模型一致性与远景回归结果，不能宣布草叶形态已获实景验证。"
}","responseSha256":"9207b55f6a210eaf6dfaeac3f935b411c68b495c5d35f2618693e3c2b80a9e64","locallyTested":{"passed":true,"casesPassed":165,"measurements":[{"t":0,"halfWidthMm":1.2},{"t":0.25,"halfWidthMm":1.1415},{"t":0.5,"halfWidthMm":0.9659999999999999},{"t":0.75,"halfWidthMm":0.6735},{"t":1,"halfWidthMm":0.26399999999999996}]}},{"taskId":"lawn-r5-a-texture_qa","actualResponseText":"{
  "name": "texture_residual",
  "expression": "-1 if floor <= 0 or photo_x < 0 or photo_y < 0 or render_x < 0 or render_y < 0 else (abs(render_x-photo_x)+abs(render_y-photo_y))/max(photo_x+photo_y,floor)",
  "diagnosis": "项目归属：校园重建 R5 草坪外观验收；拟新增产物 reports/reconstruction/lawn-r5-a-texture_qa.json。\n物理测量：相机已配准；3.41 m 灯杆只是几何尺度假设。照片没有辐射定标，也没有仅地面区域的摄影深度，不能把图像纹理误差解释为真实草叶尺寸或反射率误差。\n模型先验：infra/reconstruction/build_turf_reflectance.py 的 quilt(patches,rng) 当前等概率执行四种直角旋转，会削弱源片段的方向性；step=16、side=32 的固定拼接格和窄源片段的局部循环存在规则性风险，但尚不能据此认定已产生可见周期。44 m 双轴重复是已知贴图设置，不是实测自然尺度。\n图像结论：取 floor=0.000001，按所给数据手算，01 日照三窗的平均残差约由 bare 的 0.833 降到 blades 的 0.647，但阴影第二窗由 0.192 升至 0.640，第三窗由 0.268 升至 1.476；13 阴影第一窗约由 0.738 升至 2.566。加草叶改善部分日照细纹，却不能代表阴影窗口也改善。所附近景没有匹配实拍，不能用于宣称近景真实性达标。",
  "codeChange": "以下均为拟议修改，未写盘或运行。\n1. 新增 infra/reconstruction/lawn_texture_qa.py，精确函数名和签名为 texture_residual(photo_x, photo_y, render_x, render_y, floor)：\n\ndef texture_residual(photo_x, photo_y, render_x, render_y, floor):\n    return -1 if floor <= 0 or photo_x < 0 or photo_y < 0 or render_x < 0 or render_y < 0 else (abs(render_x-photo_x)+abs(render_y-photo_y))/max(photo_x+photo_y,floor)\n\n2. 修改 infra/reconstruction/build_turf_reflectance.py 的 quilt，签名改为 def quilt(patches,rng,quarter_turn_probability=0.25):；函数开头加入参数检查：\n    if not 0.0 <= quarter_turn_probability <= 1.0:\n        raise ValueError('quarter_turn_probability must be in [0,1]')\n将现有 patch=np.rot90(patch,int(rng.integers(4))) 替换为：\n    turns = 2 * int(rng.integers(2))\n    if rng.random() < quarter_turn_probability:\n        turns += 1\n    patch = np.rot90(patch, turns)\n保留现有镜像、局部偏移、交叉渐变、step=16、side=32 和全局连续映射。quarter_turn_probability=0.5 对应原旋转概率分布，但因随机数消耗改变，不保证逐像素复现旧版；因此旧提交必须作为独立基线。0.25 仅为待验证候选，不是已证实的修复。",
